\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialHero.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"121:41\\">By <a class=\\"codex-byline-name\\" href=\\"/about/review-board/#peter-zhang\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialHero.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"122:63\\">Peter Zhang</a> · Reviewed by <a class=\\"codex-byline-name\\" href=\\"/about/review-board/#nancy-wu\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialHero.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"127:67\\">Nancy Wu</a> · Updated <time datetime=\\"2026-07-07\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialHero.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"132:66\\">Jul 2026</time></p>  <div class=\\"codex-editorial-answer\\" aria-label=\\"Quick answer\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialHero.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"213:67\\"> <p class=\\"codex-editorial-answer-label\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialHero.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"214:47\\">Quick answer</p> <p class=\\"codex-editorial-summary\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialHero.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"215:8\\">Illustrative worked example — the figures below are modelled from typical programme parameters and vendor datasheets; they are not a named customer&#39;s measured results. A regional restaurant group with 6 locations had a quiet problem: only its unhappy guests ever left a Google review. So it put NFC tap-to-review cards on every server&#39;s apron and at every host stand — and started asking the happy ones too. In 90 days, weekly Google review volume rose 320%, average star rating increased from 4.2 to 4.6, and cost per review dropped to $0.18 — beating their previous email-survey program by an order of magnitude.</p> </div> <ul class=\\"codex-editorial-points\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialHero.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"217:40\\"> <li data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialHero.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"218:48\\">Weekly review volume +320% across 6 locations in 90 days</li><li data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialHero.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"218:48\\">Average star rating 4.2 → 4.6; total review count 870 → 3,640 in 90 days</li><li data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialHero.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"218:48\\">Cost per review: email program $4.20 → NFC tap card $0.18</li> </ul>  <div class=\\"codex-hero-cta\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialHero.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"222:37\\"> <a class=\\"codex-hero-cta-btn\\" data-cta-tier=\\"hero\\" href=\\"#quick-quote\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialHero.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"223:84\\">Get a Quick Quote</a>  </div> <div class=\\"codex-hero-trust-bar\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialHero.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"232:43\\"> <span data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialHero.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"233:18\\"><strong data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialHero.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"233:25\\">Since 2008</strong></span> <span data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialHero.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"234:18\\"><strong data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialHero.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"234:25\\">ISO 9001:2015</strong> sales &amp; service QMS</span> <span data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialHero.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"235:18\\"><strong data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialHero.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"235:25\\">Shenzhen</strong> direct supplier</span> </div>  </div> </section>        <section class=\\"codex-editorial-section codex-editorial-snapshot\\" id=\\"at-a-glance\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/DecisionSnapshot.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"42:75\\"> <h2 data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/DecisionSnapshot.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"43:7\\">At a glance</h2> <p class=\\"codex-editorial-section-intro\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/DecisionSnapshot.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"44:44\\">Use these short answers to decide whether this page matches the project before moving into the detail.</p> <div class=\\"codex-editorial-snapshot-grid\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/DecisionSnapshot.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"45:46\\"> <article class=\\"codex-card codex-editorial-snapshot-card\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/DecisionSnapshot.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"47:65\\"> <p class=\\"codex-editorial-answer-label\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/DecisionSnapshot.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"48:49\\">Key takeaway</p> <p data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/DecisionSnapshot.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"49:12\\">Weekly review volume +320% across 6 locations in 90 days</p>  </article><article class=\\"codex-card codex-editorial-snapshot-card\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/DecisionSnapshot.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"47:65\\"> <p class=\\"codex-editorial-answer-label\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/DecisionSnapshot.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"48:49\\">Where the restaurant group was before NFC</p> <p data-astr