-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/JumpNav.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"24:67\\">Where the restaurant group was before NFC</a><a class=\\"codex-editorial-jump-link\\" href=\\"#card-design-server-training-and-the-90-day-rollout\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/JumpNav.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"24:67\\">Card design, server training, and the 90-day rollout</a><a class=\\"codex-editorial-jump-link\\" href=\\"#90-day-outcomes-and-what-surprised-us\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/JumpNav.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"24:67\\">90-day outcomes and what surprised us</a><a class=\\"codex-editorial-jump-link\\" href=\\"#how-the-320-number-compares-to-industry-tap-to-review-benchmarks\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/JumpNav.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"24:67\\">How the +320% number compares to industry tap-to-review benchmarks</a><a class=\\"codex-editorial-jump-link\\" href=\\"#what-this-case-study-means-for-any-multi-location-smb\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/JumpNav.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"24:67\\">What this case study means for any multi-location SMB</a><a class=\\"codex-editorial-jump-link\\" href=\\"#useful-next-pages\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/JumpNav.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"24:67\\">Useful next pages</a><a class=\\"codex-editorial-jump-link\\" href=\\"#faq\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/JumpNav.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"24:67\\">FAQ</a><a class=\\"codex-editorial-jump-link\\" href=\\"#next-step\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/JumpNav.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"24:67\\">Next step</a><a class=\\"codex-editorial-jump-link\\" href=\\"#quick-quote\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/JumpNav.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"24:67\\">Get a quote</a></div></nav> <section class=\\"codex-editorial-section\\" id=\\"where-the-restaurant-group-was-before-nfc\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialSection.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"75:2\\"> <h2 data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialSection.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"76:7\\">Where the restaurant group was before NFC</h2> <p class=\\"codex-editorial-section-intro\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/SectionIntro.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"19:2\\">Most restaurants share a quiet statistical problem: the guests motivated enough to leave a Google review are disproportionately the ones who left unhappy. Everyone who enjoyed the meal says &#39;lovely, thanks,&#39; means it, and never types a word — so the public rating slowly fills up with the people who didn&#39;t. This group fixed the asking, not the food, and the numbers below are what happened. The customer is a regional restaurant group with 6 fast-casual locations averaging 1,800 covers/week each. Before NFC, their review-generation strategy was email-based and, to use the technical term, not working. Our <a href=\\"/blog/nfc-tap-google-review/\\">NFC tap-to-review cards explainer</a> covers the broader case for tap-to-review.</p> <ul class=\\"codex-editorial-stat-bar\\" role=\\"list\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/StatBar.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"26:52\\"><li class=\\"codex-editorial-stat-bar__item\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/StatBar.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"28:50\\"><span class=\\"codex-editorial-stat-bar__value\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/StatBar.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"29:55\\">6 locations</span><span class=\\"codex-editorial-stat-bar__label\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/StatBar.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"30:55\\">fast-casual · ~1,800 covers/wk each</span></li><li class=\\"codex-editorial-stat-bar__item\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/StatBar.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"28:50\\"><span class=\\"codex-editorial-stat-bar__value\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/StatBar.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"29:55\\">~56K covers/mo</span><span class=\\"codex-editorial-stat-bar__label\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/StatBar.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"30:55\\">combined across the group</span></li><li class=\\"codex-editorial-stat-bar__item\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/StatBar.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"28:50\\"><span class=\\"codex-editorial-stat-bar__value\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/StatBar.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"29:55\\">~20 reviews/wk</span><span class=\\"codex-editorial-stat-bar__label\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/StatBar.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"30:55\\">just 0.04% of covers converted</span></li><li class=\\"codex-editorial-stat-bar__item\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/StatBar.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"28:50\\"><span class=\\"codex-editorial-stat-bar__value\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/StatBar.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"29:55\\">4.2 / 5</span><span class=\\"codex-editorial-stat-bar__label\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/StatBar.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"30:55\\">average rating, skewed by 1-stars</span></li></ul> <figure class=\\"codex-editorial-figure\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialFigure.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"33:40\\"> <img src=\\"/diagrams/blog/restaurant-nfc-before-state.svg\\" alt=\\"Diagram: the restaurant group's pre-NFC review baseline — about 20 Google reviews a week across all 6 locations (0.04% of covers converted), a 4.2/5 average rating skewed down by upset 1-star guests, and an email-survey program with an 8% open rate, a 1.4% posted-and-public rate, and a $4.20 cost per review. The six locations ran ~1,800 covers/week each (~56K/month); the stated goal was to lift volume 3x and the rating to 4.5+ within 90 days.\\" width=\\"1200\\" height=\\"675\\" loading=\\"lazy\\" decoding=\\"async\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialFigure.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"34:4\\"> </figure>      <ul class=\\"codex-editorial-list\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/SectionList.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"38:38\\"><li data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/SectionList.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"40:10\\">Locations: 6 stores, ~1,800 covers/week each = ~56K covers/month total.</li><li data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/SectionList.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"40:10\\">Pre-NFC review volume: ~20 Google reviews/week across all 6 locations combined (0.04% conversion).</li><li data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/SectionList.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"40:10\\">Average star rating: 4.2/5 — skewed by 1-star reviews from upset guests; happy guests rarely posted.</li><li data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/SectionList.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"40:10\\">Email-survey program: 8% open rate, 1.4% completed-and-posted-publicly rate, $4.20 per review when factoring service cost + incentives.</li><li data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/SectionList.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"40:10\\">Goal: lift volume 3x and star rating to 4.5+ within 90 days; secondary goal — beat the email program on cost per review.</li></ul>     </section><section class=\\"codex-editorial-section\\" id=\\"card-design-server-training-and-the-90-day-rollout\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialSection.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"75:2\\"> <h2 data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialSection.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"76:7\\">Card design, server training, and the 90-day rollout</h2> <p class=\\"codex-editorial-section-intro\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/SectionIntro.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"19:2\\">The hardware was deliberately unremarkable, which was the entire point — nothing on the table should make a guest stop and think. We sourced NTAG 215 PVC cards in two formats: a server-apron card with a leash clip (worn during service) and a host-stand desk easel for guests waiting for tables. Both pointed to a per-location dynamic URL that landed straight on Google&#39;s review form — no app to open, no business to search for. See our <a href=\\"/solutions/google-review-nfc-card/\\">Google review NFC card programme guide</a> for the spec details.</p>  <figure class=\\"codex-editorial-figure\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialFigure.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"33:40\\"> <img src=\\"/diagrams/blog/restaurant-nfc-card-and-rollout.svg\\" alt=\\"Diagram: the two NFC card formats and their shared spec. A server-apron card (8 per location on a leash clip, replaced quarterly for apron wear) and a host-stand easel (an NFC card behind acrylic with a 3-tap demo card for older phones), both built on NTAG 215, 86×54mm, full-color CMYK with brand-color spot lamination, and a dynamic per-location URL, at $0.43 each at MOQ 5K. The dynamic URL appends a location ID and server ID to feed a quarterly server-recognition program; 84 servers were trained on a 30-second 'if you had a great experience, scan here' close.\\" width=\\"1200\\" height=\\"675\\" loading=\\"lazy\\" decoding=\\"async\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialFigure.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"34:4\\"> </figure>      <ul class=\\"codex-editorial-list\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/SectionList.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"38:38\\"><li data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/SectionList.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"40:10\\">Card spec: NTAG 215, 86×54mm, full-color CMYK + brand-color spot lamination, dynamic URL with per-location tracking, $0.43 each at MOQ 5K.</li><li data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/SectionList.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"40:10\\">Server cards: 8 per location with apron leash clip; replaced quarterly due to apron wear.</li><li data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/SectionList.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"40:10\\">Host stand: branded easel with NFC card embedded behind acrylic; instruction card with 3-tap demo for guests with older phones.</li><li data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/SectionList.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"40:10\\">Server script: trained 84 servers on a 30-second &quot;if you had a great experience, scan here&quot; close — paired with a tableside compliment from manager.</li><li data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/SectionList.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"40:10\\">Tracking: dynamic URL appended location ID + server ID; review attribution feeds quarterly server-recognition program.</li></ul>     </section><section class=\\"codex-editorial-section\\" data-section-type=\\"results\\" id=\\"90-day-outcomes-and-what-surprised-us\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialSection.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"75:2\\"> <h2 data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialSection.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"76:7\\">90-day outcomes and what surprised us</h2> <p class=\\"codex-editorial-section-intro\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/SectionIntro.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"19:2\\">All four KPIs — volume, star rating, cost-per-review, and server-recognition uplift — cleared their targets within 60 days, which is the kind of result that makes a cautious operations director quietly re-open the dashboard to check it twice. The surprises, though, were the fun part. For more on review-card economics for restaurants, see our <a href=\\"/blog/google-review-nfc-cards-restaurants/\\">Google review NFC cards for restaurants guide</a>.</p>  <figure class=\\"codex-editorial-figure\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialFigure.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"33:40\\"> <img src=\\"/diagrams/blog/restaurant-nfc-results-climb.svg\\" alt=\\"Line chart: weekly Google review volume across the 6 locations climbing from a ~20/week baseline, past the 3x target of ~60/week around day 60 (when all 4 KPIs cleared), to 84/week by day 90 — a 320% increase. Alongside the climb, the average star rating rose 4.2 → 4.6, cumulative 90-day reviews went 870 → 3,640, and 11% of reviews now mention a server by name, up from under 1% before.\\" width=\\"1200\\" height=\\"675\\" loading=\\"lazy\\" decoding=\\"async\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialFigure.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"34:4\\"> </figure>  <aside class=\\"codex-editorial-data-highlight\\" role=\\"figure\\" aria-label=\\"Cost per review, fully loaded\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/DataHighlight.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"27:82\\"> <span class=\\"codex-editorial-data-highlight__value\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/DataHighlight.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"28:55\\">$0.18</span> <strong class=\\"codex-editorial-data-highlight__heading\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/DataHighlight.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"29:59\\">Cost per review, fully loaded</strong> <p class=\\"codex-editorial-data-highlight__text\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/DataHighlight.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"30:4\\">Down from $4.20 on the old email program — an order-of-magnitude drop, with the card cost amortized over its expected 6-month service life and zero incentive spend.</p> <cite class=\\"codex-editorial-data-highlight__source\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/DataHighlight.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"31:67\\">Source: Customer program economics; card cost amortized over expected 6-month service life, no incentive cost.</cite> </aside>    <ul class=\\"codex-editorial-list\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/SectionList.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"38:38\\"><li data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/SectionList.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"40:10\\">Review volume: 20/week → 84/week across 6 locations (+320%); cumulative 90-day count 870 → 3,640.</li><li data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/SectionList.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"40:10\\">Average star rating: 4.2 → 4.6; meaningful because Google&#39;s local-search ranking weights both volume and recency heavily.</li><li data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/SectionList.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"40:10\\">Cost per review: $0.18 fully loaded (card cost amortized over expected 6-month service life + 0 incentive cost).</li><li data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/SectionList.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"40:10\\">Server-recognition uplift: top 5 servers per location now identified by review attribution; turnover among top-quartile servers dropped from 22% to 9% annualized.</li><li data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/SectionList.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"40:10\\">Surprise win: 11% of Google reviews now mention a server by name (vs &lt;1% before); this is a leading indicator of &quot;engaged guest&quot; repeat-visit rate.</li></ul>     </section><section class=\\"codex-editorial-section\\" id=\\"how-the-320-number-compares-to-industry-tap-to-review-benchmarks\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialSection.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"75:2\\"> <h2 data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialSection.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"76:7\\">How the +320% number compares to industry tap-to-review benchmarks</h2> <p class=\\"codex-editorial-section-intro\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/SectionIntro.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"19:2\\">A single case study is, in the end, an anecdote in a well-pressed suit — so before you take the +320% on faith, here it is lined up against the published record. TAPro&#39;s 75-80% tap-to-review completion rate across 11,500+ businesses, EmbedSocial&#39;s case-study reports of 3-5x review velocity, and TAPiTAG&#39;s customer outcomes of 2-3x review increases all sit in the same range as the restaurant group&#39;s results. Anchoring against external data also tells SMB operators what *not* to expect — fluctuations are normal in months 1-2 before staff scripts stabilize.</p>  <figure class=\\"codex-editorial-figure\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialFigure.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"33:40\\"> <img src=\\"/diagrams/blog/restaurant-nfc-benchmark-comparison.svg\\" alt=\\"Bar chart of tap-to-review completion rate: TAPro's published band is 75-80% across 11,500+ SMBs, TAPro's quick-service diner case study is 75%, this restaurant group measured 78% on tapped sessions (inside the published band), and the old email follow-up completed at 8%. A footer adds the velocity yardsticks — EmbedSocial-style cafés ~5x, TAPiTAG and Wiremo 2-3x, this group 4.2x — and the Map Pack benchmark: TAPro's Luxe Salon took a top-3 slot on 59 reviews in 30 days, while this group averages ~60 reviews per location per month.\\" width=\\"1200\\" height=\\"675\\" loading=\\"lazy\\" decoding=\\"async\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialFigure.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"34:4\\"> </figure>      <ul class=\\"codex-editorial-list\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/SectionList.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"38:38\\"><li data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/SectionList.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"40:10\\">TAPro publishes a 75-80% tap-to-review completion rate across an installed base of 11,500+ SMBs (cafes, salons, dental, auto repair). The restaurant group hit 78% completion on tapped sessions, well within the published band.</li><li data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/SectionList.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"40:10\\">EmbedSocial-style café benchmark: monthly reviews 12 → 60 (5x) when paper reminders are replaced with tap cards. The restaurant group&#39;s per-location ratio (3.3 → 14/week) is consistent with that ratio when normalized for cover volume.</li><li data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/SectionList.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"40:10\\">TAPiTAG and Wiremo both report SMB review velocity 2-3x as a typical floor for a six-month measurement window. The restaurant group&#39;s 4.2x lift in week-over-week velocity reflects the apron-card placement (server hand-off vs static counter card).</li><li data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/SectionList.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"40:10\\">Quick-service diner data point cited by TAPro: 75% review completion when a card is handed with every order, vs 8% for email follow-up — the same ~10x gap the restaurant group measured between email ($4.20/review) and tap ($0.18/review).</li><li data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/SectionList.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"40:10\\">Local Map Pack benchmark from TAPro Luxe Salon case: 59 reviews in 30 days drove a top-3 Map Pack position. The restaurant group&#39;s per-location average of ~14/week (≈60/month) lands in the same Map Pack acceleration zone.</li></ul>     </section><section class=\\"codex-editorial-section\\" data-section-type=\\"results\\" id=\\"what-this-case-study-means-for-any-multi-location-smb\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialSection.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"75:2\\"> <h2 data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialSection.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"76:7\\">What this case study means for any multi-location SMB</h2> <p class=\\"codex-editorial-section-intro\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/SectionIntro.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"19:2\\">The restaurant group&#39;s economics work for one unglamorous reason: NFC tap-to-review collapses 4-6 manual steps (open Google → search business → scroll to reviews → tap &#39;write a review&#39; → write → submit) into 1 tap that lands directly on Google&#39;s review form. Every step you remove is a guest you don&#39;t lose to second thoughts. SMB operators considering the same playbook should size their card budget against three numbers: cover volume, current review velocity, and email-survey cost per review. The 4-6 month payback window is the practical benchmark.</p>  <figure class=\\"codex-editorial-figure\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialFigure.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"33:40\\"> <img src=\\"/diagrams/blog/restaurant-nfc-one-tap-collapse.svg\\" alt=\\"Diagram contrasting the review paths: the old way is 4-6 manual steps (open Google, search the business, scroll to reviews, tap 'write a review', write it, submit), while the NFC way is a single tap that lands on Google's review form already open. A footer carries the economics — $0.18 per review versus $4.20 on the old email program, a breakeven at 510 incremental reviews, and a Map Pack lift from 145 to 607 reviews per location over 90 days.\\" width=\\"1200\\" height=\\"675\\" loading=\\"lazy\\" decoding=\\"async\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialFigure.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"34:4\\"> </figure>      <ul class=\\"codex-editorial-list\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/SectionList.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"38:38\\"><li data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/SectionList.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"40:10\\">Card unit economics: NTAG 215 PVC, full-color, dynamic per-location URL, 5K MOQ → $0.30-$0.50 per card depending on finish. Apron leash clip + acrylic host-stand easel adds ~$2-$4 fixed cost per location.</li><li data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/SectionList.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"40:10\\">Payback math: at $0.18/review fully loaded vs $4.20/review email cost, breakeven happens at 510 incremental reviews — typically 4-6 weeks for a multi-location restaurant doing 200+ covers/day.</li><li data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/SectionList.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"40:10\\">Server-attribution multiplier: dynamic URLs that append location_id + server_id let GMs run quarterly recognition programs. The customer&#39;s top-quartile server turnover dropped from 22% to 9% — saving ~$2,400/server in replacement cost (NRA average for fast-casual).</li><li data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/SectionList.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"40:10\\">Googl​e Map Pack effect: per BrightLocal 2025 Local Search ranking factor study, review count and recency are top-5 signals. Going from 145/location to 607/location in 90 days moves a 4.4-star location into local-pack consideration where it was previously buried.</li><li data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/SectionList.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"40:10\\">Operational risks to manage: card loss (replace quarterly), apron wear (laminate or NTAG215 with ferrite backing for moisture resistance), and Google&#39;s review-gating policy — never route negative-intent guests to a private form, only the public Google form.</li></ul>     </section> <section class=\\"codex-editorial-section codex-editorial-resource-shell\\" id=\\"useful-next-pages\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/ResourceGrid.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"31:81\\"> <h2 data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/ResourceGrid.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"32:7\\">Useful next pages</h2> <p class=\\"codex-editorial-section-intro\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/ResourceGrid.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"33:44\\">Use these linked product, guide and comparison pages to keep the next click specific and practical.</p> <div class=\\"codex-editorial-resource-grid\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/ResourceGrid.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"34:46\\"> <section class=\\"codex-card codex-editorial-card\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/ResourceCard.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"31:50\\"> <h2 data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/ResourceCard.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"32:7\\">NFC tap-to-review cards</h2> <p data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/ResourceCard.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"33:6\\">NTAG 215 cards in PVC with full-color brand finish and dynamic per-location URLs.</p> <div class=\\"codex-editorial-link-list\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/ResourceCard.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"34:42\\"> <a class=\\"codex-editorial-link-card\\" href=\\"/products/rfid-cards/\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/ResourceCard.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"36:61\\"> <strong data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/ResourceCard.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"37:17\\">NFC review cards</strong>  </a> </div> </section><section class=\\"codex-card codex-editorial-card\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/ResourceCard.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"31:50\\"> <h2 data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/ResourceCard.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"32:7\\">NFC keyfobs and stickers for hospitality</h2> <p data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/ResourceCard.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"33:6\\">Alternative NFC formats for table-tents, server lanyards, and host-stand displays.</p> <div class=\\"codex-editorial-link-list\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/ResourceCard.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"34:42\\"> <a class=\\"codex-editorial-link-card\\" href=\\"/products/rfid-keyfobs/\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/ResourceCard.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"36:61\\"> <strong data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/ResourceCard.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"37:17\\">NFC keyfobs</strong>  </a> </div> </section><section class=\\"codex-card codex-editorial-card\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/ResourceCard.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"31:50\\"> <h2 data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/ResourceCard.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"32:7\\">Get an NFC review card quote</h2> <p data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/ResourceCard.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"33:6\\">Per-location dynamic URLs, brand finishes, and quarterly reorder programs.</p> <div class=\\"codex-editorial-link-list\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/ResourceCard.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"34:42\\"> <a class=\\"codex-editorial-link-card\\" href=\\"/contact/nfc-branding-cards/\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/ResourceCard.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"36:61\\"> <strong data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/ResourceCard.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"37:17\\">NFC review card quote</strong>  </a> </div> </section><section class=\\"codex-card codex-editorial-card\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/ResourceCard.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"31:50\\"> <h2 data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/ResourceCard.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"32:7\\">Industry tap-to-review benchmarks</h2> <p data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/ResourceCard.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"33:6\\">Published completion-rate and velocity data from TAPro, EmbedSocial, and TAPiTAG to validate your own pilot.</p> <div class=\\"codex-editorial-link-list\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/ResourceCard.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"34:42\\"> <a class=\\"codex-editorial-link-card\\" href=\\"https://taprocard.com/blogs/article/google-review-card-guide\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/ResourceCard.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"36:61\\"> <strong data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/ResourceCard.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"37:17\\">TAPro how Google review cards work</strong>  </a><a class=\\"codex-editorial-link-card\\" href=\\"https://embedsocial.com/blog/get-google-reviews-with-nfc-card/\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/ResourceCard.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"36:61\\"> <strong data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/ResourceCard.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"37:17\\">EmbedSocial step-by-step guide</strong>  </a> </div> </section> </div> </section> <section class=\\"codex-editorial-section\\" id=\\"faq\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/Faq.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"24:50\\"> <h2 data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/Faq.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"25:7\\">FAQ</h2> <div class=\\"codex-editorial-faq\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/Faq.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"26:36\\"> <details data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/Faq.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"28:16\\"> <summary data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/Faq.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"29:18\\">Doesn&#39;t Google penalize &#39;review gating&#39; or solicited reviews?</summary> <p data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/Faq.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"30:12\\">Google prohibits incentivizing reviews and prohibits gating (filtering negative reviews to private channels). The customer&#39;s program does neither — every guest who taps lands on the public Google form regardless of intent. That kept the program compliant.</p> </details><details data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/Faq.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"28:16\\"> <summary data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/Faq.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"29:18\\">What happens if a guest&#39;s phone doesn&#39;t support NFC?</summary> <p data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/Faq.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"30:12\\">All cards include a printed QR code as a fallback. ~12% of taps use the QR; the rest are NFC. Mid-priced Android and all iPhone 7+ devices read NFC tags out of the box.</p> </details><details data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/Faq.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"28:16\\"> <summary data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/Faq.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"29:18\\">Did star rating actually improve organically or just from positive selection?</summary> <p data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/Faq.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"30:12\\">Both. Selection effect (asking happy guests to review) explains most of the lift. The customer&#39;s actual operating quality is unchanged — but the surfaced sentiment now better reflects average guest experience.</p> </details><details data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/Faq.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"28:16\\"> <summary data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/Faq.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"29:18\\">What did the cards cost in total for 6 locations?</summary> <p data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/Faq.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"30:12\\">$2,150 for the initial 5,000-card order + $480/quarter for replacements = $4,070 in year one. Cost per review ($0.18) reflects amortization across the 22,400 reviews projected for year one.</p> </details><details data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/Faq.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"28:16\\"> <summary data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/Faq.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"29:18\\">What&#39;s the realistic completion rate when a guest taps the card?</summary> <p data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/Faq.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"30:12\\">Industry-published benchmarks from TAPro (75-80% across 11,500+ SMBs) and TAPro&#39;s quick-service diner case study (75%) are the right anchor. The restaurant group measured 78% completion on tapped sessions. Drop-off happens mostly when guests hit a Google sign-in prompt and don&#39;t have a Google account on the device — about 10-15% of taps.</p> </details><details data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/Faq.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"28:16\\"> <summary data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/Faq.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"29:18\\">How long until a single-location SMB sees ROI on a similar program?</summary> <p data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/Faq.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"30:12\\">For a single-location coffee shop or salon doing 100-300 daily transactions, payback typically lands in 4-6 weeks. The math: 200 transactions/day × 30 days × 5% tap rate × 75% completion = ~225 reviews/month. At $0.50/card amortized over 6 months and 50 cards in service, the fully loaded cost lands near $0.20-$0.30 per review — beating any email survey or paid ad alternative.</p> </details> </div> </section>  <section class=\\"codex-trust-signals\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/TrustSignals.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"15:38\\"> <div class=\\"codex-trust-stats\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/TrustSignals.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"16:34\\"> <div class=\\"codex-trust-stat\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/TrustSignals.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"17:35\\"> <strong data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/TrustSignals.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"18:15\\">Since 2008</strong> <span data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/TrustSignals.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"19:13\\">Shenzhen, China</span> </div> <div class=\\"codex-trust-stat\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/TrustSignals.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"21:35\\"> <strong data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/TrustSignals.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"22:15\\">ISO 9001:2015</strong> <span data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/TrustSignals.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"23:13\\">Certified sales &amp; service QMS</span> </div> <div class=\\"codex-trust-stat\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/TrustSignals.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"25:35\\"> <strong data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/TrustSignals.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"26:15\\">ISO 14001 · 45001</strong> <span data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/TrustSignals.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"27:13\\">Certificates published</span> </div> <div class=\\"codex-trust-stat\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/TrustSignals.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"29:35\\"> <strong data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/TrustSignals.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"30:15\\">18 years</strong> <span data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/TrustSignals.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"31:13\\">In operation</span> </div> </div> <p class=\\"codex-trust-note\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/TrustSignals.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"34:31\\">Proud Tek is a Shenzhen-based supplier of custom RFID &amp; NFC cards, tags, labels, wristbands, keyfobs and readers for hotels, laundries, events, retail and industrial programmes. Certificate numbers and scope are published on <a href=\\"/about/certifications/\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/TrustSignals.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"34:293\\">the certifications page</a>; stock sample packs are free for qualified B2B buyers (courier at your cost).</p> </section> <section class=\\"codex-inl