tro-source-loc=\\"24:67\\">Where luxury NFC is actually earning its keep</a><a class=\\"codex-editorial-jump-link\\" href=\\"#a-luxury-nfc-program-phase-by-phase\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/JumpNav.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"24:67\\">A luxury NFC program, phase by phase</a><a class=\\"codex-editorial-jump-link\\" href=\\"#static-qr-vs-dynamic-sun-nfc-the-argument-creative-will-hear\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/JumpNav.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"24:67\\">Static QR vs dynamic SUN NFC — the argument creative will hear</a><a class=\\"codex-editorial-jump-link\\" href=\\"#standards-dpp-and-the-questions-your-legal-team-will-ask\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/JumpNav.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"24:67\\">Standards, DPP and the questions your legal team will ask</a><a class=\\"codex-editorial-jump-link\\" href=\\"#useful-next-pages\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/JumpNav.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"24:67\\">Useful next pages</a><a class=\\"codex-editorial-jump-link\\" href=\\"#faq\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/JumpNav.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"24:67\\">FAQ</a><a class=\\"codex-editorial-jump-link\\" href=\\"#sources\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/JumpNav.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"24:67\\">Sources</a><a class=\\"codex-editorial-jump-link\\" href=\\"#next-step\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/JumpNav.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"24:67\\">Next step</a><a class=\\"codex-editorial-jump-link\\" href=\\"#quick-quote\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/JumpNav.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"24:67\\">Get a quote</a></div></nav> <section class=\\"codex-editorial-section\\" id=\\"what-proud-tek-supplies-to-luxury-brands\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialSection.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"75:2\\"> <h2 data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialSection.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"76:7\\">What Proud Tek supplies to luxury brands</h2> <p class=\\"codex-editorial-section-intro\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/SectionIntro.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"19:2\\">Luxury-category NFC splits cleanly into four form factors, each with a distinct integration constraint — handbags and leather goods, watches and jewellery, sneakers and apparel, wine / spirits / cosmetic packaging. The common chip across all four is NXP&#39;s NTAG 424 DNA family (with or without the tamper-loop &#39;TT&#39; variant), chosen because it supports AES-128 SUN/CMAC dynamic URLs on stock NFC phones without an app.</p> <ul class=\\"codex-editorial-stat-bar\\" role=\\"list\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/StatBar.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"26:52\\"><li class=\\"codex-editorial-stat-bar__item\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/StatBar.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"28:50\\"><span class=\\"codex-editorial-stat-bar__value\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/StatBar.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"29:55\\">AES-128</span><span class=\\"codex-editorial-stat-bar__label\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/StatBar.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"30:55\\">CMAC-signed SUN on every tap</span></li><li class=\\"codex-editorial-stat-bar__item\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/StatBar.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"28:50\\"><span class=\\"codex-editorial-stat-bar__value\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/StatBar.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"29:55\\">No app</span><span class=\\"codex-editorial-stat-bar__label\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/StatBar.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"30:55\\">opens in phone browser</span></li><li class=\\"codex-editorial-stat-bar__item\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/StatBar.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"28:50\\"><span class=\\"codex-editorial-stat-bar__value\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/StatBar.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"29:55\\">0.1–0.3 mm</span><span class=\\"codex-editorial-stat-bar__label\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/StatBar.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"30:55\\">inlay thickness, invisible</span></li><li class=\\"codex-editorial-stat-bar__item\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/StatBar.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"28:50\\"><span class=\\"codex-editorial-stat-bar__value\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/StatBar.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"29:55\\">GS1 DL</span><span class=\\"codex-editorial-stat-bar__label\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/StatBar.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"30:55\\">DPP-compatible URL shape</span></li></ul>            </section><section class=\\"codex-editorial-section\\" id=\\"ntag-424-dna-vs-dna-tt-vs-desfire-ev3-vs-ntag215-which-chip-does-luxury-actually-need\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialSection.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"75:2\\"> <h2 data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialSection.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"76:7\\">NTAG 424 DNA vs DNA TT vs DESFire EV3 vs NTAG215 — which chip does luxury actually need?</h2> <p class=\\"codex-editorial-section-intro\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/SectionIntro.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"19:2\\">Pick the chip before you pick the form factor. The matrix below is the single most-asked question across luxury NFC projects.</p>          <div class=\\"codex-scroll-region codex-editorial-table-wrap\\" tabindex=\\"0\\" role=\\"region\\" aria-label=\\"Comparison table — scroll horizontally to see more columns\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialTable.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"59:2\\"> <table class=\\"codex-editorial-table\\" data-sortable=\\"true\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialTable.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"60:61\\"> <thead data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialTable.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"61:12\\"> <tr data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialTable.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"62:11\\"> <th scope=\\"col\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialTable.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"65:29\\"> <span class=\\"codex-th-label\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialTable.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"66:44\\">Capability</span> </th><th scope=\\"col\\" data-sort-col=\\"1\\" aria-sort=\\"none\\" tabindex=\\"0\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialTable.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"74:14\\"> <span class=\\"codex-th-label\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialTable.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"75:44\\">NTAG 424 DNA</span> <span class=\\"codex-th-indicator\\" aria-hidden=\\"true\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialTable.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"76:16\\"></span> </th><th scope=\\"col\\" data-sort-col=\\"2\\" aria-sort=\\"none\\" tabindex=\\"0\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialTable.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"74:14\\"> <span class=\\"codex-th-label\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<proj