astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"87:14\\">Yes, AES-128 CMAC</td><td data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialTable.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"87:14\\">Yes, AES-128 CMAC</td><td data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialTable.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"87:14\\">Yes, AES-128 mutual auth</td><td data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialTable.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"87:14\\">No — static UID</td> </tr><tr data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialTable.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"84:13\\"> <th scope=\\"row\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialTable.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"85:27\\">Seal / tamper loop</th> <td data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialTable.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"87:14\\"><span class=\\"codex-cell-glyph\\" data-cell-glyph=\\"no\\" aria-label=\\"Not supported\\" role=\\"img\\">No</span></td><td data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialTable.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"87:14\\">Yes, hardware, irreversible</td><td data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialTable.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"87:14\\"><span class=\\"codex-cell-glyph\\" data-cell-glyph=\\"no\\" aria-label=\\"Not supported\\" role=\\"img\\">No</span></td><td data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialTable.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"87:14\\"><span class=\\"codex-cell-glyph\\" data-cell-glyph=\\"no\\" aria-label=\\"Not supported\\" role=\\"img\\">No</span></td> </tr><tr data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialTable.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"84:13\\"> <th scope=\\"row\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialTable.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"85:27\\">App-free verification (iOS + Android)</th> <td data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialTable.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"87:14\\">Yes — browser URL</td><td data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialTable.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"87:14\\">Yes — browser URL</td><td data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialTable.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"87:14\\">Needs custom app or reader</td><td data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialTable.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"87:14\\">Yes, but clonable</td> </tr><tr data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialTable.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"84:13\\"> <th scope=\\"row\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialTable.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"85:27\\">Cloning posture</th> <td data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialTable.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"87:14\\">Not feasible in the field</td><td data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialTable.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"87:14\\">Not feasible in the field</td><td data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialTable.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"87:14\\">Not feasible in the field</td><td data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialTable.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"87:14\\">Trivially cloned on a €20 reader</td> </tr><tr data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialTable.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"84:13\\"> <th scope=\\"row\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialTable.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"85:27\\">GS1 Digital Link / DPP shape</th> <td data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialTable.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"87:14\\"><span class=\\"codex-cell-glyph\\" data-cell-glyph=\\"yes\\" aria-label=\\"Supported\\" role=\\"img\\">Yes</span></td><td data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialTable.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"87:14\\"><span class=\\"codex-cell-glyph\\" data-cell-glyph=\\"yes\\" aria-label=\\"Supported\\" role=\\"img\\">Yes</span></td><td data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialTable.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"87:14\\">Possible but overkill</td><td data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialTable.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"87:14\\">Yes — not secure</td> </tr><tr data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialTable.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"84:13\\"> <th scope=\\"row\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialTable.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"85:27\\">Typical luxury fit</th> <td data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialTable.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"87:14\\">Handbags, sneakers, apparel, packaging</td><td data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialTable.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"87:14\\">Wine capsules, watch seals, blister closures</td><td data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialTable.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"87:14\\">Boutique / e-commerce access and payment</td><td data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialTable.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"87:14\\">Entry-level marketing tags only</td> </tr> </tbody> </table> </div>  <aside class=\\"codex-editorial-callout\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialCallout.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"24:40\\"> <strong data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialCallout.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"25:11\\">Rule of thumb</strong> <p data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialCallout.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"26:4\\">Pick NTAG 424 DNA TT when a broken seal must be cryptographically proven. Pick NTAG 424 DNA when the product itself is the tag carrier and the seal is not part of the story. Never pick <a href=\\"/compare/ntag213-vs-ntag215-vs-ntag216/\\" title=\\"NTAG chips\\">NTAG215</a> if the threat model includes counterfeit production.</p> <a href=\\"/products/rfid-cards/ntag424-dna-tt-card/\\" class=\\"codex-editorial-callout__link\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialCallout.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"28:58\\">Learn more <span aria-hidden=\\"true\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialCallout.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"28:94\\">→</span></a> </aside> </section><section class=\\"codex-editorial-section\\" id=\\"where-luxury-nfc-is-actually-earning-its-keep\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialSection.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"75:2\\"> <h2 data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialSection.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"76:7\\">Where luxury NFC is actually earning its keep</h2> <p class=\\"codex-editorial-section-intro\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/SectionIntro.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"19:2\\">The six highest-value applications in the current luxury-category pipeline, each keyed to the brand outcome it delivers.</p>     <div class=\\"codex-editorial-feature-grid\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/FeatureGrid.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"33:45\\"><article class=\\"codex-editorial-feature\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/FeatureGrid.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"35:64\\"><span class=\\"codex-editorial-feature__icon\\" aria-hidden=\\"true\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/FeatureIcon.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"37:66\\">🛡️</span><h3 class=\\"codex-editorial-feature__title\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/FeatureGrid.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"37:52\\">Tap-to-verify on handbags</h3><p class=\\"codex-editorial-feature__text\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/FeatureGrid.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"38:10\\">Ultra-thin inlay behind the leather lining or inside the patch. Consumer taps on boutique / on arrival home; SUN URL resolves to a branded Genuine Product page.</p></article><article class=\\"codex-editorial-feature\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/FeatureGrid.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"35:64\\"><span class=\\"codex-editorial-feature__icon\\" aria-hidden=\\"true\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/FeatureIcon.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"37:66\\">⌚</span><h3 class=\\"codex-editorial-feature__title\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/FeatureGrid.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"37:52\\">Watch and jewellery case authentication</h3><p class=\\"codex-editorial-feature__text\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/FeatureGrid.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"38:10\\">Miniature 6–12 mm NFC inlays fit the case back or inner bezel; a concierge or collector taps with their phone and sees the serial, service history and digital certificate of authenticity.</p></article><article class=\\"codex-editorial-feature\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/FeatureGrid.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"35:64\\"><span class=\\"codex-editorial-feature__icon\\" aria-hidden=\\"true\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/FeatureIcon.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"37:66\\">👟</span><h3 class=\\"codex-editorial-feature__title\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/FeatureGrid.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"37:52\\">Sneaker and streetwear provenance</h3><p class=\\"codex-editorial-feature__text\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/FeatureGrid.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"38:10\\">Tongue, insole or hang-tag inlay for limited drops and collaborations; the same tap that authenticates also unlocks owner content and resale eligibility.</p></article><article class=\\"codex-editorial-feature\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/FeatureGrid.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"35:64\\"><span class=\\"codex-editorial-feature__icon\\" aria-hidden=\\"true\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/FeatureIcon.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"37:66\\">🍾</span><h3 class=\\"codex-editorial-feature__title\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/FeatureGrid.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"37:52\\">Wine, spirits, cosmetic seals</h3><p class=\\"codex-editorial-feature__text\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/FeatureGrid.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"38:10\\">NTAG 424 DNA TT on the capsule or closure — breaking the seal trips the tamper loop permanently, and every subsequent tap says &#39;opened&#39;.</p></article><article class=\\"codex-editorial-feature\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/FeatureGrid.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"35:64\\"><span class=\\"codex-editorial-feature__icon\\" aria-hidden=\\"true\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/FeatureIcon.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"37:66\\">🔗</span><h3 class=\\"codex-editorial-feature__title\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/FeatureGrid.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"37:52\\">Digital Product Passport entry point</h3><p class=\\"codex-editorial-feature__text\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/FeatureGrid.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"38:10\\">Same tap URL doubles as the DPP landing page via GS1 Digital Link, giving you one physical carrier for authenticity and regulatory compliance.</p></article><article class=\\"codex-editorial-feature\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/FeatureGrid.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"35:64\\"><span class=\\"codex-editorial-feature__icon\\" aria-hidden=\\"true\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/FeatureIcon.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"37:66\\">🔄</span><h3 class=\\"codex-editorial-feature__title\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/FeatureGrid.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"37:52\\">Certified pre-owned + resale</h3><p class=\\"codex-editorial-feature__text\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/FeatureGrid.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"38:10\\">The chip remains with the product; ownership transfer is recorded on the brand&#39;s backend (or an Aura-style consortium ledger), unlocking a trustworthy secondary market.</p></article></div>        </section><section class=\\"codex-editorial-section\\" id=\\"a-luxury-nfc-program-phase-by-phase\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialSection.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"75:2\\"> <h2 data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialSection.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"76:7\\">A luxury NFC program, phase by phase</h2> <p class=\\"codex-editorial-section-intro\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/SectionIntro.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"19:2\\">The rollout rhythm luxury houses converge on after one or two pilots. Skipping any phase is where programs blow up.</p>       <ol class=\\"codex-editorial-timeline\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/Timeline.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"29:40\\"><li class=\\"codex-editorial-timeline__item\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/Timeline.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"31:50\\"><span class=\\"codex-editorial-timeline__label\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/Timeline.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"32:55\\">Phase 0 — Creative + legal alignment</span><p class=\\"codex-editorial-timeline__text\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/Timeline.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"33:10\\">Brand creative, legal and data-privacy teams agree on what the tap-to-verify landing page says, what consumer data it collects and which jurisdictions it serves. Missing this phase is why two-thirds of shelved luxury NFC programs die.</p></li><li class=\\"codex-editorial-timeline__item\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/Timeline.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"31:50\\"><span class=\\"codex-editorial-timeline__label\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/Timeline.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"32:55\\">Phase 1 — Chip + inlay pilot</span><p class=\\"codex-editorial-timeline__text\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/Timeline.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"33:10\\">500–2,000 inlays produced against the final chip choice and placed into actual sample products. Read-reliability is verified under real lining, leather and metal.</p></li><li class=\\"codex-editorial-timeline__item\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/Timeline.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"31:50\\"><span class=\\"codex-editorial-timeline__label\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/Timeline.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"32:55\\">Phase 2 — Personalisation pipeline</span><p class=\\"codex-editorial-timeline__text\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/Timeline.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"33:10\\">Key diversification moves into an HSM or cloud KMS; serial / SGTIN assignment runs against the manufacturer&#39;s ERP; we integrate with the factory line so every inlay leaves production with its per-unit encoding.</p></li><li class=\\"codex-editorial-timeline__item\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/Timeline.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"31:50\\"><span class=\\"codex-editorial-timeline__label\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/Timeline.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"32:55\\">Phase 3 — Season / drop rollout</span><p class=\\"codex-editorial-timeline__text\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/Timeline.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"33:10\\">Full season or drop ships with tag; boutiques, e-commerce returns and customs all read consistent SUN URLs. Tap telemetry begins flowing: region, first-tap latency, grey-market anomalies.</p></li><li class=\\"codex-editorial-timeline__item\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/Timeline.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"31:50\\"><span class=\\"codex-editorial-timeline__label\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/Timeline.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"32:55\\">Phase 4 — Resale + service loop</span><p class=\\"codex-editorial-timeline__text\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/Timeline.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"33:10\\">Ownership transfer endpoint goes live; service history, warranty activation and certified-pre-owned verification share the same chip. At this point NFC stops being a marketing feature and becomes infrastructure.</p></li></ol>      </section><section class=\\"codex-editorial-section\\" id=\\"static-qr-vs-dynamic-sun-nfc-the-argument-creative-will-hear\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialSection.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"75:2\\"> <h2 data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialSection.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"76:7\\">Static QR vs dynamic SUN NFC — the argument creative will hear</h2> <p class=\\"codex-editorial-section-intro\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/SectionIntro.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"19:2\\">Most luxury brand-protection programs start with QR and stall at reprint-and-reuse counterfeiting. Keeping the creative team aligned on why NFC (specifically, dynamic-URL NFC) is the step-up requires the comparison below at hand.</p>      <div class=\\"codex-editorial-compare-panel\\" role=\\"group\\" aria-label=\\"Before vs after comparison\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/ComparePanel.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"28:97\\"> <div class=\\"codex-editorial-compare-panel__col codex-editorial-compare-panel__col--before\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/ComparePanel.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"29:94\\"> <h3 data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/ComparePanel.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"30:9\\">Static QR or basic NTAG21x</h3> <ul class=\\"codex-editorial-list\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/ComparePanel.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"31:38\\"> <li data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/ComparePanel.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"33:10\\">Same URL every scan — counterfeiters photograph one genuine label and reuse it on fakes.</li><li data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/ComparePanel.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"33:10\\">Clonable with a €20 reader and a blank tag; no signal to the brand or consumer that anything is off.</li><li data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/ComparePanel.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"33:10\\">No tamper evidence — opened or re-sealed products look identical to unopened stock.</li><li data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/ComparePanel.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"33:10\\">No useful tap telemetry — brand cannot see regional patterns, grey-market movements or first-tap latency.</li><li data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/ComparePanel.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"33:10\\">Consumer trust erodes as counterfeit-with-working-QR floods the secondary market.</li> </ul> </div> <div class=\\"codex-editorial-compare-panel__col codex-editorial-compare-panel__col--after\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/ComparePanel.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"37:93\\"> <h3 data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/ComparePanel.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"38:9\\">NTAG 424 DNA / DNA TT</h3> <ul class=\\"codex-editorial-list\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/ComparePanel.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"39:38\\"> <li data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/ComparePanel.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"41:10\\">Every tap returns a cryptographically unique URL — photographing or replaying a previous tap fails server verification.</li><li data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/ComparePanel.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"41:10\\">AES-128 CMAC signatures per card-unique diversified key; cloning requires the key, which never leaves the chip.</li><li data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/ComparePanel.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"41:10\\">Hardware tamper loop (DNA TT) flips an irreversible bit that is signed into every later tap.</li><li data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/ComparePanel.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"41:10\\">Tap telemetry becomes a brand intelligence product: regional heat map, grey-market alerts, activation rate.</li><li data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/ComparePanel.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"41:10\\">Consumer sees a branded &#39;Genuine, first tap in region EU&#39; before purchase — the trust moment.</li> </ul> </div> </div>       </section><section class=\\"codex-editorial-section\\" id=\\"standards-dpp-and-the-questions-your-legal-team-will-ask\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialSection.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"75:2\\"> <h2 data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialSection.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"76:7\\">Standards, DPP and the questions your legal team will ask</h2> <p class=\\"codex-editorial-section-intro\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/SectionIntro.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"19:2\\">Luxury NFC sits on a stack of standards and regulations; here is the authoritative set your engineering and legal teams should reference when specifying the program.</p>        <ul class=\\"codex-editorial-list\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/SectionList.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"38:38\\"><li data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/SectionList.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"40:10\\">ISO/IEC 14443-3:2018 — baseline HF contactless protocol for every NFC phone, guarantees iOS + Android compatibility.</li><li data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/SectionList.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"40:10\\">NFC Forum Type 4 Tag Operation — specifies the NDEF URL model that makes &#39;tap opens browser&#39; work out of the box.</li><li data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/SectionList.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"40:10\\">NIST SP 800-38B (CMAC) — algorithmic basis for the SUN signature used by NTAG 424 DNA family chips.</li><li data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/SectionList.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"40:10\\">GS1 Digital Link — the preferred URL shape for Digital Product Passport readiness; keep your SUN URL GS1-DL compliant from day one.</li><li data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/SectionList.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"40:10\\">EU Regulation 2024/1781 (ESPR) — Digital Product Passport obligation rolling in category by category from 2026 onward.</li><li data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/SectionList.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"40:10\\">EUIPO Anti-Counterfeiting Technology Guide — endorses SUN-style dynamic authentication as a credible anti-counterfeit technology for luxury goods.</li></ul> <ul class=\\"codex-editorial-checklist\\" role=\\"list\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/Checklist.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"23:53\\"><li class=\\"codex-editorial-checklist__item\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/Checklist.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"25:51\\"><span class=\\"codex-editorial-checklist__mark\\" aria-hidden=\\"true\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/Checklist.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"26:74\\">✓</span><span class=\\"codex-editorial-checklist__text\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/Checklist.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"27:10\\">Agree master-key custody and HSM location before the first production inlay is personalised.</span></li><li class=\\"codex-editorial-checklist__item\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/Checklist.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"25:51\\"><span class=\\"codex-editorial-checklist__mark\\" aria-hidden=\\"true\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/Checklist.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"26:74\\">✓</span><span class=\\"codex-editorial-checklist__text\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/Checklist.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"27:10\\">Decide tap-counter policy: strict monotonic (reject re-tap) vs drift-tolerant; plan for counter rollover.</span></li><li class=\\"codex-editorial-checklist__item\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/Checklist.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"25:51\\"><span class=\\"codex-editorial-checklist__mark\\" aria-hidden=\\"true\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/Checklist.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"26:74\\">✓</span><span class=\\"codex-editorial-checklist__text\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/Checklist.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"27:10\\">Model tamper state as irreversible in CRM, warranty and service — do not let &#39;repair + reseal&#39; clear it.</span></li><li class=\\"codex-editorial-checklist__item\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/Checklist.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"25:51\\"><span class=\\"codex-editorial-checklist__mark\\" aria-hidden=\\"true\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/Checklist.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"26:74\\">✓</span><span class=\\"codex-editorial-checklist__text\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/Checklist.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"27:10\\">Shape the SUN URL as a GS1 Digital Link from day one so a future DPP scope expansion does not force an inlay re-spin.</span></li><li class=\\"codex-editorial-checklist__item\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/Checklist.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"25:51\\"><span class=\\"codex-editorial-checklist__mark\\" aria-hidden=\\"true\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/Checklist.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"26:74\\">✓</span><span class=\\"codex-editorial-checklist__text\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/Checklist.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"27:10\\">Define the grey-market response copy (branded &#39;genuine but out-of-region&#39;) before the first anomaly hits the dashboard.</span></li></ul>    </section> <section class=\\"codex-editorial-section codex-editorial-resource-shell\\" id=\\"useful-next-pages\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/ResourceGrid.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"31:81\\"> <h2 data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/ResourceGrid.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"32:7\\">Useful next pages</h2> <p class=\\"codex-editorial-section-intro\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/ResourceGrid.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"33:44\\">Use these linked product, guide and comparison pages to keep the next click specific and practical.</p> <div class=\\"codex-editorial-resource-grid\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/ResourceGrid.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"34:46\\"> <section class=\\"codex-card codex-editorial-card\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/ResourceCard.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"31:50\\"> <h2 data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/ResourceCard.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"32:7\\">Luxury NFC SKUs</h2> <p data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/ResourceCard.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"33:6\\">The tag variants we produce for leather goods, watches, sneakers, apparel, wine and packaging.</p> <div class=\\"codex-editorial-link-list\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/ResourceCard.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"34:42\\"> <a class=\\"codex-editorial-link-card\\" href=\\"/products/rfid-cards/ntag424-dna-tt-card/\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/ResourceCard.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"36:61\\"> <strong data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/ResourceCard.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"37:17\\">NTAG 424 DNA TT cards</strong>  </a><a class=\\"codex-editorial-link-card\\" href=\\"/products/rfid-labels/nfc-luxury-handbag-tag/\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/ResourceCard.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"36:61\\"> <strong data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/ResourceCard.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"37:17\\">NFC luxury handbag tags</strong>  </a><a class=\\"codex-editorial-link-card\\" href=\\"/products/rfid-labels/nfc-sneaker-authentication-tag/\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/ResourceCard.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"36:61\\"> <strong data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/ResourceCard.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"37:17\\">NFC sneaker authentication tags</strong>  </a><a class=\\"codex-editorial-link-card\\" href=\\"/products/rfid-labels/nfc-art-provenance-tag/\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/ResourceCard.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"36:61\\"> <strong data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/ResourceCard.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"37:17\\">NFC art provenance tags</strong>  </a><a class=\\"codex-editorial-link-card\\" href=\\"/products/rfid-labels/nfc-warranty-seal-tag/\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/ResourceCard.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"36:61\\"> <strong data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/ResourceCard.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"37:17\\">NFC warranty seal tags (luxury packaging)</strong>  </a><a class=\\"codex-editorial-link-card\\" href=\\"/products/rfid-tags/rfid-jewelry-tag/\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/ResourceCard.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"36:61\\"> <strong data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/ResourceCard.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"37:17\\">UHF RFID jewelry tags</strong>  </a><a class=\\"codex-editorial-link-card\\" href=\\"/products/rfid-labels/nfc-gaming-collectible-tag/\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/ResourceCard.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"36:61\\"> <strong data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/ResourceCard.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"37:17\\">NFC gaming and collectible tags (limited-edition + IP-defended)</strong>  </a> </div> </section><section class=\\"codex-card codex-editorial-card\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/ResourceCard.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"31:50\\"> <h2 data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/ResourceCard.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"32:7\\">Programs and solutions</h2> <p data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/ResourceCard.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"33:6\\">How the luxury NFC chip connects to your broader brand-protection and DPP program.</p> <div class=\\"codex-editorial-link-list\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/ResourceCard.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"34:42\\"> <a class=\\"codex-editorial-link-card\\" href=\\"/solutions/nfc-brand-authentication/\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/ResourceCard.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"36:61\\"> <strong data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/ResourceCard.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"37:17\\">NFC brand authentication program</strong>  </a><a class=\\"codex-editorial-link-card\\" href=\\"/solutions/nfc-luxury-authentication/\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/ResourceCard.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"36:61\\"> <strong data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/ResourceCard.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"37:17\\">NFC luxury authentication solution</strong>  </a><a class=\\"codex-editorial-link-card\\" href=\\"/solutions/digital-product-passport/\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/ResourceCard.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"36:61\\"> <strong data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/ResourceCard.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"37:17\\">Digital Product Passport solution</strong>  </a> </div> </section><section class=\\"codex-card codex-editorial-card\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/ResourceCard.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"31:50\\"> <h2 data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/ResourceCard.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"32:7\\">Technical deep-dives and related verticals</h2> <p data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/ResourceCard.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"33:6\\">For engineering teams that need the full reference before committing.</p> <div class=\\"codex-editorial-link-list\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/ResourceCard.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"34:42\\"> <a class=\\"codex-editorial-link-card\\" href=\\"/guides/ntag424-dna-sun-cmac-authentication/\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/ResourceCard.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"36:61\\"> <strong data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/ResourceCard.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"37:17\\">NTAG 424 DNA SUN + CMAC guide</strong>  </a><a class=\\"codex-editorial-link-card\\" href=\\"/industries/brand-protection/\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/ResourceCard.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"36:61\\"> <strong data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/ResourceCard.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"37:17\\">Brand protection industry landing</strong>  </a><a class=\\"codex-editorial-link-card\\" href=\\"/industries/pharmaceutical/\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/ResourceCard.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"36:61\\"> <strong data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/ResourceCard.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"37:17\\">Pharmaceutical industry (adjacent use cases)</strong>  </a><a class=\\"codex-editorial-link-card\\" href=\\"/solutions/google-review-cards-for-retail-stores/\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/ResourceCard.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"36:61\\"> <strong data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/ResourceCard.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"37:17\\">Google review NFC cards for retail stores (boutique luxury)</strong>  </a><a class=\\"codex-editorial-link-card\\" href=\\"/blog/luxury-resale-nfc-authentication/\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/ResourceCard.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"36:61\\"> <strong data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/ResourceCard.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"37:17\\">Luxury resale authentication with NFC</strong>  </a> </div> </section> </div> </section> <section class=\\"codex-editorial-section\\" id=\\"faq\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/Faq.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"24:50\\"> <h2 data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/Faq.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"25:7\\">FAQ</h2> <div class=\\"codex-editorial-faq\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/Faq.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"26:36\\"> <details data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/Faq.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"28:16\\"> <summary data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/Faq.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"29:18\\">How does NFC authentication actually prevent luxury counterfeiting?</summary> <p data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/Faq.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"30:12\\">NTAG 424 DNA chips sign every tap with an AES-128 CMAC. The signature includes the chip&#39;s UID, a monotonically increasing tap counter and (on the TT variant) the tamper-loop bit. Your backend re-computes that signature with the card-unique diversified key; a mismatch or a replayed counter fails. The secret key never leaves the chip, so a counterfeiter cannot produce valid signatures even if they record the last tap.</p> </details><details data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/Faq.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"28:16\\"> <summary data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/Faq.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"29:18\\">Can an NFC tag be embedded in a handbag without affecting the aesthetic?</summary> <p data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/Faq.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"30:12\\">Yes. Our luxury inlays are 0.1–0.3 mm thick and can be laminated behind leather linings, inside structural inserts, under watch case backs or inside jewellery clasps. The consumer taps their phone on the general area — no visible tag or marking is required. We always pilot on the actual leather / fabric / casing before a production run because antenna tuning varies with substrate.</p> </details><details data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/Faq.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"28:16\\"> <summary data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/Faq.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"29:18\\">What does the EU Digital Product Passport mean for luxury textiles and leather goods?</summary> <p data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/Faq.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"30:12\\">EU Regulation 2024/1781 (ESPR) makes Digital Product Passports mandatory for categories rolled out from 2026 onward; textiles are on the early wave. A DPP has to carry material composition, supply-chain origin, durability and recycling data in a machine-readable, web-resolvable form. NFC is the most consumer-friendly carrier for luxury because it fits the tap moment the brand already wants. Keep the tap URL shaped as a GS1 Digital Link from day one and your NFC inlay serves authenticity and DPP from one chip.</p> </details><details data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/Faq.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"28:16\\"> <summary data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/Faq.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"29:18\\">Does the NFC tag enable resale and secondary-market provenance?</summary> <p data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/Faq.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"30:12\\">Yes. The chip&#39;s unique ID and tap telemetry are the infrastructure for certified-pre-owned. Your backend records ownership transfer, service events and authentication history keyed to that chip; resale partners verify authenticity with a tap instead of a manual inspection. Some houses publish the trace to a consortium ledger (Aura); others keep it inside their own brand cloud. Either pattern works on the same NTAG 424 DNA chip.</p> </details><details data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/Faq.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"28:16\\"> <summary data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/Faq.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"29:18\\">What happens if the NFC tag is damaged or removed?</summary> <p data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/Faq.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"30:12\\">Damaged inlay = product is treated as non-verified on future taps. Physically removed inlay = the product cannot re-authenticate, which typically disqualifies it from brand service and resale programs. For wine, spirits and closure tags the tamper-loop TT variant treats the break as irreversible — the chip keeps reporting &#39;tampered&#39; even if someone tries to rebuild the trace. Design the product assembly so removing the tag damages the garment or packaging; that is the combined physical + cryptographic deterrent.</p> </details><details data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/Faq.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"28:16\\"> <summary data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/Faq.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"29:18\\">How does the phone know which URL to open when I tap?</summary> <p data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/Faq.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"30:12\\">The tag writes an NDEF record containing the SUN URL. iOS (13+) and Android open NDEF URLs directly in the browser on tap — no app required. Your branded verification page renders on the phone with the &#39;Genuine&#39; / &#39;Tampered&#39; result. Brands that want a native app (for loyalty push, wallet integration, Apple/Google Pay passes) layer the app on top of the same tag; consumers with the app get the native flow, everyone else still gets the browser experience.</p> </details><details data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/Faq.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"28:16\\"> <summary data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/Faq.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"29:18\\">What is the MOQ and lead time for luxury NFC inlays?</summary> <p data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/Faq.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"30:12\\">Typical MOQ is 500 inlays for NTAG 424 DNA TT with custom SUN URL configuration; 15–20 business days, including AES key diversification and tap-counter setup. Plain NTAG 424 DNA inlays run at MOQ 1,000, 15 business days. Bespoke form factors (watch case, wine capsule, sneaker tongue) add 5–10 business days for the first run as we tune the antenna to the chosen substrate.</p> </details><details data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/Faq.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"28:16\\"> <summary data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/Faq.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"29:18\\">How does Aura Blockchain Consortium use NFC for luxury provenance?</summary> <p data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/Faq.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"30:12\\">Aura Blockchain Consortium (founded 2021 by LVMH, Prada, Richemont, joined by OTB, Mercedes-Benz and others) operates a permissioned ledger that records the manufacturing, ownership and service history of luxury items. Member brands typically anchor the chain identifier in an NTAG 424 DNA tap-to-verify NFC tag embedded in the product; the SUN/CMAC signature authenticates the unit, then the brand back-end queries Aura for the provenance trace. ARIANEE provides a similar service for independent maisons on a public consortium. Both architectures work on the same NXP silicon and need no app on the consumer side. See https://auraconsortium.com and https://www.arianee.org.</p> </details><details data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/Faq.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"28:16\\"> <summary data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/Faq.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"29:18\\">When does the EU Digital Product Passport become mandatory for luxury textiles?</summary> <p data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/Faq.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"30:12\\">EU Regulation 2024/1781 (ESPR) replaced the 2009 Ecodesign Directive and introduces the Digital Product Passport (DPP) for product categories defined in delegated acts. The first DPP delegated acts target batteries (already in force under Regulation 2023/1542 from February 2027), textiles and apparel (expected 2026-2027), furniture, tyres and electronics. DPP fields include material composition, repair manual, recycled-content percentage, supply-chain origin and chemical-substance data, served via a unique identifier resolvable per GS1 Digital Link (ISO/IEC 18975). NFC is the dominant proposed carrier for clothing and leather goods because the tap moment already exists. See https://eur-lex.europa.eu/eli/reg/2024/1781/oj.</p> </details><details data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/Faq.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"28:16\\"> <summary data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/Faq.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"29:18\\">Can NFC tags survive watch service or handbag refurbishment?</summary> <p data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/Faq.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"30:12\\">Yes, with planning. NXP NTAG 424 DNA inlays are 0.1-0.3 mm thick and operate from -25 degC to +85 degC; they survive ultrasonic cleaning baths used in watch service (under 60 degC, neutral pH) and leather conditioning. Tag placement must avoid the bezel removal path and the steam-press zone on handbag refurbishment, which can exceed 110 degC for short periods. Re-pairing the chip to a new service record requires the brand back-end to ingest the post-service tap with a recognised technician credential. Aura, ARIANEE and bespoke brand-cloud architectures all support service-event re-binding without re-issuing the chip. Pilot on each substrate before production.</p> </details> </div> </section> <section id=\\"sources\\" class=\\"codex-sources\\" aria-labelledby=\\"sources-heading\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/Sources.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"60:76\\"><h2 id=\\"sources-heading\\" class=\\"codex-sources-heading\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/Sources.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"61:60\\">Sources &amp; references</h2><p class=\\"codex-sources-lead\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/Sources.astro\\" data-astro-so