Tek Editorial Team</a> · Reviewed by <a class=\\"codex-byline-name\\" href=\\"/about/review-board/#proudtek-engineering\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialHero.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"127:67\\">Proud Tek RF / Production Engineering</a> · Updated <time datetime=\\"2026-06-11\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialHero.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"132:66\\">Jun 2026</time></p>  <div class=\\"codex-editorial-answer\\" aria-label=\\"Quick answer\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialHero.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"213:67\\"> <p class=\\"codex-editorial-answer-label\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialHero.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"214:47\\">Quick answer</p> <p class=\\"codex-editorial-summary\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialHero.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"215:8\\">Luxury NFC embeds NXP NTAG 424 DNA or NTAG 424 DNA TagTamper inlays (ISO/IEC 14443 Type A, 13.56 MHz, AES-128 SUN/CMAC per NXP AN12196 and NIST SP 800-38B) invisibly into handbags, watch case backs, sneaker tongues, wine capsules and packaging closures, so each tap on an iPhone (iOS 14+) or Android phone returns a fresh cryptographic signature that consumer-grade clones cannot forge. The same tap doubles as the carrier for the EU Digital Product Passport mandated by Regulation 2024/1781 (ESPR), shaped as a GS1 Digital Link URL, and feeds certified-pre-owned provenance ledgers such as the Aura Blockchain Consortium (LVMH, Prada, Richemont, OTB, Mercedes-Benz) and ARIANEE. Industry data shows tap-to-verify pages converting at 25-50% versus single-digit rates for app-gated flows and a 60-80% drop in marketplace counterfeit-listing takedown latency.</p> </div> <ul class=\\"codex-editorial-points\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialHero.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"217:40\\"> <li data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialHero.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"218:48\\">Tap-to-verify on any NFC phone — no app, no friction. Each tap returns a fresh AES-128 CMAC-signed URL (SUN/SDM); cloning and replay both fail server verification.</li><li data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialHero.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"218:48\\">DPP-ready from day one — the tap URL can be encoded as a GS1 Digital Link, which is the pattern the EU Digital Product Passport (ESPR, 2024/1781) points toward for textiles and consumer goods.</li><li data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialHero.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"218:48\\">Resale provenance — the same chip that confirms authenticity at point of sale carries ownership transfer and service history into the secondary market, underpinning certified-pre-owned programs.</li> </ul>  <div class=\\"codex-hero-cta\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialHero.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"222:37\\"> <a class=\\"codex-hero-cta-btn\\" data-cta-tier=\\"hero\\" href=\\"#quick-quote\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialHero.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"223:84\\">Get a Quick Quote</a>  </div> <div class=\\"codex-hero-trust-bar\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialHero.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"232:43\\"> <span data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialHero.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"233:18\\"><strong data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialHero.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"233:25\\">Since 2008</strong></span> <span data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialHero.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"234:18\\"><strong data-astr