=\\"what-proud-tek-supplies-to-luxury-brands\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialSection.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"75:2\\"> <h2 data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialSection.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"76:7\\">What Proud Tek supplies to luxury brands</h2> <p class=\\"codex-editorial-section-intro\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/SectionIntro.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"19:2\\">Luxury-category NFC splits cleanly into four form factors, each with a distinct integration constraint — handbags and leather goods, watches and jewellery, sneakers and apparel, wine / spirits / cosmetic packaging. The common chip across all four is NXP&#39;s NTAG 424 DNA family (with or without the tamper-loop &#39;TT&#39; variant), chosen because it supports AES-128 SUN/CMAC dynamic URLs on stock NFC phones without an app.</p> <ul class=\\"codex-editorial-stat-bar\\" role=\\"list\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/StatBar.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"26:52\\"><li class=\\"codex-editorial-stat-bar__item\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/StatBar.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"28:50\\"><span class=\\"codex-editorial-stat-bar__value\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/StatBar.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"29:55\\">AES-128</span><span class=\\"codex-editorial-stat-bar__label\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/StatBar.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"30:55\\">CMAC-signed SUN on every tap</span></li><li class=\\"codex-editorial-stat-bar__item\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/StatBar.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"28:50\\"><span class=\\"codex-editorial-stat-bar__value\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/StatBar.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"29:55\\">No app</span><span class=\\"codex-editorial-stat-bar__label\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/StatBar.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"30:55\\">opens in phone browser</span></li><li class=\\"codex-editorial-stat-bar__item\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/StatBar.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"28:50\\"><span class=\\"codex-editorial-stat-bar__value\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/StatBar.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"29:55\\">0.1–0.3 mm</span><span class=\\"codex-editorial-stat-bar__label\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/StatBar.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"30:55\\">inlay thickness, invisible</span></li><li class=\\"codex-editorial-stat-bar__item\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/StatBar.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"28:50\\"><span class=\\"codex-editorial-stat-bar__value\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/StatBar.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"29:55\\">GS1 DL</span><span class=\\"codex-editorial-stat-bar__label\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/StatBar.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"30:55\\">DPP-compatible URL shape</span></li></ul>            </section><section class=\\"codex-editorial-section\\" id=\\"ntag-424-dna-vs-dna-tt-vs-desfire-ev3-vs-ntag215-which-chip-does-luxury-actually-need\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialSection.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"75:2\\"> <h2 data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialSection.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"76:7\\">NTAG 424 DNA vs DNA TT vs DESFire EV3 vs NTAG215 — which chip does luxury actually need?</h2> <p class=\\"codex-editorial-section-intro\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/SectionIntro.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"19:2\\"