s/editorial/EditorialTable.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"85:27\\">App-free verification (iOS + Android)</th> <td data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialTable.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"87:14\\">Yes — browser URL</td><td data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialTable.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"87:14\\">Yes — browser URL</td><td data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialTable.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"87:14\\">Needs custom app or reader</td><td data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialTable.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"87:14\\">Yes, but clonable</td> </tr><tr data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialTable.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"84:13\\"> <th scope=\\"row\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialTable.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"85:27\\">Cloning posture</th> <td data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialTable.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"87:14\\">Not feasible in the field</td><td data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialTable.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"87:14\\">Not feasible in the field</td><td data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialTable.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"87:14\\">Not feasible in the field</td><td data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialTable.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"87:14\\">Trivially cloned on a €20 reader</td> </tr><tr data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialTable.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"84:13\\"> <th scope=\\"row\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialTable.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"85:27\\">GS1 Digital Link / DPP shape</th> <td data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialTable.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"87:14\\"><span class=\\"codex-cell-glyph\\" data-cell-glyph=\\"yes\\" aria-label=\\"Supported\\" role=\\"img\\">Yes</span></td><td data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialTable.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"87:14\\"><span class=\\"codex-cell-glyph\\" data-cell-glyph=\\"yes\\" aria-label=\\"Supported\\" role=\\"img\\">Yes</span></td><td data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialTable.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"87:14\\">Possible but overkill</td><td data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialTable.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"87:14\\">Yes — not secure</td> </tr><tr data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialTable.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"84:13\\"> <th scope=\\"row\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialTable.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"85:27\\">Typical luxury fit</th> <td data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialTable.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"87:14\\">Handbags, sneakers, apparel, packaging</td><td data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialTable.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"87:14\\">Wine capsules, watch seals, blister closures</td><td data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialTable.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"87:14\\">Boutique / e-commerce access and payment</td><td data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialTable.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"87:14\\">Entry-level marketing tags only</td> </tr> </tbody> </table> </div>  <aside class=\\"codex-editorial-callout\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialCallout.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"24:40\\"> <strong data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialCallout.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"25:11\\">Rule of thumb</strong> <p data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialCallout.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"26:4\\">Pick NTAG 424 DNA TT when a broken seal must be cryptographically proven. Pick NTAG 424 DNA when the product itself is the tag carrier and the seal is not part of the story. Never pick <a href=\\"/compare/ntag213-vs-ntag215-vs-ntag216/\\" title=\\"NTAG chips\\">NTAG215</a> if the threat model includes counterfeit production.</p> <a href=\\"/products/rfid-cards/ntag424-dna-tt-card/\\" class=\\"codex-editorial-callout__link\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialCallout.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"28:58\\">Learn more <span aria-hidden=\\"true\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialCallout.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"28:94\\">→</span></a> </aside> </section><section class=\\"codex-editorial-section\\" id=\\"where-luxury-nfc-is-actually-earning-its-keep\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialSection.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"75:2\\"> <h2 data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialSection.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"76:7\\">Where luxury NFC is actually earning its keep</h2> <p class=\\"codex-editorial-section-intro\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/SectionIntro.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"19:2\\">The six highest-value applications in the current luxury-category pipeline, each keyed to the brand outcome it delivers.</p>     <div class=\\"codex-editorial-feature-grid\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/FeatureGrid.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"33:45\\"><article class=\\"codex-editorial-feature\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/FeatureGrid.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"35:64\\"><span class=\\"codex-editorial-feature__icon\\" aria-hidden=\\"true\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/FeatureIcon.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"37:66\\">🛡️</span><h3 class=\\"codex-editorial-feature__title\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/FeatureGrid.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"37:52\\">Tap-to-verify on handbags</h3><p class=\\"codex-editorial-feature__text\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/FeatureGrid.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"38:10\\">Ultra-thin inlay behind the leather lining or inside the patch. Consumer taps on boutique / on arrival home; SUN URL resolves to a branded Genuine Product page.</p></article><article class=\\"codex-editorial-feature\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/FeatureGrid.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"35:64\\"><span class=\\"codex-editorial-feature__icon\\" aria-hidden=\\"true\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/FeatureIcon.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"37:66\\">⌚</span><h3 class=\\"codex-editorial-feature__title\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/FeatureGrid.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"37:52\\">Watch and jewellery case authentication</h3><p class=\\"codex-editorial-feature__text\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/FeatureGrid.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"38:10\\">Miniature 6–12 mm NFC inlays fit the case back or inner bezel; a concierge or collector taps with their phone and sees the serial, service history and digital certificate of authenticity.</p></article><article class=\\"codex-editorial-feature\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/FeatureGrid.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"35:64\\"><span class=\\"codex-editorial-feature__icon\\" aria-hidden=\\"true\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/FeatureIcon.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"37:66\\">👟</span><h3 class=\\"codex-editorial-feature__title\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/FeatureGrid.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"37:52\\">Sneaker and streetwear provenance</h3><p class=\\"codex-editorial-feature__text\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/FeatureGrid.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"38:10\\">Tongue, insole or hang-tag inlay for limited drops and collaborations; the same tap that authenticates also unlocks owner content and resale eligibility.</p></article><article class=\\"codex-editorial-feature\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/FeatureGrid.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"35:64\\"><span class=\\"codex-editorial-feature__icon\\" aria-hidden=\\"true\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/FeatureIcon.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"37:66\\">🍾</span><h3 class=\\"codex-editorial-feature__title\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/FeatureGrid.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"37:52\\">Wine, spirits, cosmetic seals</h3><p class=\\"codex-editorial-feature__text\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/FeatureGrid.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"38:10\\">NTAG 424 DNA TT on the capsule or closure — breaking the seal trips the tamper loop permanently, and every subsequent tap says &#39;opened&#39;.</p></article><article class=\\"codex-editorial-feature\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/FeatureGrid.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"35:64\\"><span class=\\"codex-editorial-feature__icon\\" aria-hidden=\\"true\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/FeatureIcon.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"37:66\\">🔗</span><h3 class=\\"codex-editorial-feature__title\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/FeatureGrid.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"37:52\\">Digital Product Passport entry point</h3><p class=\\"codex-editorial-feature__text\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/FeatureGrid.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"38:10\\">Same tap URL doubles as the DPP landing page via GS1 Digital Link, giving you one physical carrier for authenticity and regulatory compliance.</p></article><article class=\\"codex-editorial-feature\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/FeatureGrid.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"35:64\\"><span class=\\"codex-editorial-feature__icon\\" aria-hidden=\\"true\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/FeatureIcon.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"37:66\\">🔄</span><h3 class=\\"codex-editorial-feature__title\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/FeatureGrid.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"37:52\\">Certified pre-owned + resale</h3><p class=\\"codex-editorial-feature__text\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/FeatureGrid.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"38:10\\">The chip remains with the product; ownership transfer is recorded on the brand&#39;s backend (or an Aura-style consortium ledger), unlocking a trustworthy secondary market.</p></article></div>        </section><section class=\\"codex-editorial-section\\" id=\\"a-luxury-nfc-program-phase-by-phase\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialSection.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"75:2\\"> <h2 data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialSection.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"76:7\\">A luxury NFC program, phase by phase</h2> <p class=\\"codex-editorial-section-intro\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/SectionIntro.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"19:2\\">The rollout rhythm luxury houses converge on after one or two pilots. Skipping any phase is where programs blow up.</p>       <ol class=\\"codex-editorial-timeline\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/Timeline.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"29:40\\"><li class=\\"codex-editorial-timeline__item\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/Timeline.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"31:50\\"><span class=\\"codex-editorial-timeline__label\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/Timeline.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"32:55\\">Phase 0 — Creative + legal alignment</span><p class=\\"codex-editorial-timeline__text\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/Timeline.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"33:10\\">Brand creative, legal and data-privacy teams agree on what the tap-to-verify landing page says, what consumer data it collects and which jurisdictions it serves. Missing this phase is why two-thirds of shelved luxury NFC programs die.</p></li><li class=\\"codex-editorial-timeline__item\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/Timeline.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"31:50\\"><span class=\\"codex-editorial-timeline__label\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/Timeline.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"32:55\\">Phase 1 — Chip + inlay pilot</span><p class=\\"codex-editorial-timeline__text\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/Timeline.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"33:10\\">500–2,000 inlays produced against the final chip choice and placed into actual sample products. Read-reliability is verified under real lining, leather and metal.</p></li><li class=\\"codex-editorial-timeline__item\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/Timeline.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"31:50\\"><span class=\\"codex-editorial-timeline__label\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/Timeline.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"32:55\\">Phase 2 — Personalisation pipeline</span><p class=\\"codex-editorial-timeline__text\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/Timeline.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"33:10\\">Key diversification moves into an HSM or cloud KMS; serial / SGTIN assignment runs against the manufacturer&#39;s ERP; we integrate with the factory line so every inlay leaves production with its per-unit encoding.</p></li><li class=\\"codex-editorial-timeline__item\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/Timeline.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"31:50\\"><span class=\\"codex-editorial-timeline__label\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/Timeline.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"32:55\\">Phase 3 — Season / drop rollout</span><p class=\\"codex-editorial-timeline__text\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/Timeline.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"33:10\\">Full season or drop ships with tag; boutiques, e-commerce returns and customs all read consistent SUN URLs. Tap telemetry begins flowing: region, first-tap latency, grey-market anomalies.</p></li><li class=\\"codex-editorial-timeline__item\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/Timeline.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"31:50\\"><span class=\\"codex-editorial-timeline__label\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/Timeline.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"32:55\\">Phase 4 — Resale + service loop</span><p class=\\"codex-editorial-timeline__text\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/Timeline.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"33:10\\">Ownership transfer endpoint goes live; service history, warranty activation and certified-pre-owned verification share the same chip. At this point NFC stops being a marketing feature and becomes infrastructure.</p></li></ol>      </section><section class=\\"codex-editorial-section\\" id=\\"static-qr-vs-dynamic-sun-nfc-the-argument-creative-will-hear\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialSection.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"75:2\\"> <h2 data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialSection.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"76:7\\">Static QR vs dynamic SUN NFC — the argument creative will hear</h2> <p class=\\"codex-editorial-section-intro\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/SectionIntro.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"19:2\\">Most luxury brand-protection programs start with QR and stall at reprint-and-reuse counterfeiting. Keeping the creative team aligned on why NFC (specifically, dynamic-URL NFC) is the step-up requires the comparison below at hand.</p>      <div class=\\"codex-editorial-compare-panel\\" role=\\"group\\" aria-label=\\"Before vs after comparison\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/ComparePanel.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"28:97\\"> <div class=\\"codex-editorial-compare-panel__col codex-editorial-compare-panel__col--before\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/ComparePanel.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"29:94\\"> <h3 data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/ComparePanel.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"30:9\\">Static QR or basic NTAG21x</h3> <ul class=\\"codex-editorial-list\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/ComparePanel.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"31:38\\"> <li data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/ComparePanel.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"33:10\\">Same URL every scan — counterfeiters photograph one genuine label and reuse it on fakes.</li><li data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/ComparePanel.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"33:10\\">Clonable with a €20 reader and a blank tag; no signal to the brand or consumer that anything is off.</li><li data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/ComparePanel.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"33:10\\">No tamper evidence — opened or re-sealed products look identical to unopened stock.</li><li data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/ComparePanel.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"33:10\\">No useful tap telemetry — brand cannot see regional patterns, grey-market movements or first-tap latency.</li><li data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/ComparePanel.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"33:10\\">Consumer trust erodes as counterfeit-with-working-QR floods the secondary market.</li> </ul> </div> <div class=\\"codex-editorial-compare-panel__col codex-editorial-compare-panel__col--after\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/ComparePanel.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"37:93\\"> <h3 data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/ComparePanel.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"38:9\\">NTAG 424 DNA / DNA TT</h3> <ul class=\\"codex-editorial-list\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/ComparePanel.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"39:38\\"> <li data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/ComparePanel.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"41:10\\">Every tap returns a cryptographically unique URL — photographing or replaying a previous tap fails server verification.</li><li data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/ComparePanel.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"41:10\\">AES-128 CMAC signatures per card-unique diversified key; cloning requires the key, which never leaves the chip.</li><li data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/ComparePanel.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"41:10\\">Hardware tamper loop (DNA TT) flips an irreversible bit that is signed into every later tap.</li><li data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/ComparePanel.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"41:10\\">Tap telemetry becomes a brand intelligence product: regional heat map, grey-market alerts, activation rate.</li><li data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/ComparePanel.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"41:10\\">Consumer sees a branded &#39;Genuine, first tap in region EU&#39; before purchase — the trust moment.</li> </ul> </div> </div>       </section><section class=\\"codex-editorial-section\\" id=\\"standards-dpp-and-the-questions-your-legal-team-will-ask\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialSection.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"75:2\\"> <h2 data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialSection.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"76:7\\">Standards, DPP and the questions your legal team will ask</h2> <p class=\\"codex-editorial-section-intro\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/SectionIntro.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"19:2\\">Luxury NFC sits on a stack of standards and regulations; here is the authoritative set your engineering and legal teams should reference when specifying the program.</p>        <ul class=\\"codex-editorial-list\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/SectionList.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"38:38\\"><li data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/SectionList.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"40:10\\">ISO/IEC 14443-3:2018 — baseline HF contactless protocol for every NFC phone, guarantees iOS + Android compatibility.</li><li data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/SectionList.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"40:10\\">NFC Forum Type 4 Tag Operation — specifies the NDEF URL model that makes &#39;tap opens browser&#39; work out of the box.</li><li data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/SectionList.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"40:10\\">NIST SP 800-38B (CMAC) — algorithmic basis for the SUN signature used by NTAG 424 DNA family chips.</li><li data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/SectionList.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"40:10\\">GS1 Digital Link — the preferred URL shape for Digital Product Passport readiness; keep your SUN URL GS1-DL compliant from day one.</li><li data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/SectionList.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"40:10\\">EU Regulation 2024/1781 (ESPR) — Digital Product Passport obligation rolling in category by category from 2026 onward.</li><li data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/SectionList.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"40:10\\">EUIPO Anti-Counterfeiting Technology Guide — endorses SUN-style dynamic authentication as a credible anti-counterfeit technology for luxury goods.</li></ul> <ul class=\\"codex-editorial-checklist\\" role=\\"list\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/Checklist.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"23:53\\"><li class=\\"codex-editorial-checklist__item\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/Checklist.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"25:51\\"><span class=\\"codex-editorial-checklist__mark\\" aria-hidden=\\"true\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/Checklist.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"26:74\\">✓</span><span class=\\"codex-editorial-checklist__text\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/Checklist.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"27:10\\">Agree master-key custody and HSM location before the first production inlay is personalised.</span></li><li class=\\"codex-editorial-checklist__item\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/Checklist.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"25:51\\"><span class=\\"codex-editorial-checklist__mark\\" aria-hidden=\\"true\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/Checklist.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"26:74\\">✓</span><span class=\\"codex-editorial-checklist__text\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/Checklist.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"27:10\\">Decide tap-counter policy: strict monotonic (reject re-tap) vs drift-tolerant; plan for counter rollover.</span></li><li class=\\"codex-editorial-checklist__item\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/Checklist.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"25:51\\"><span class=\\"codex-editorial-checklist__mark\\" aria-hidden=\\"true\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/Checklist.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"26:74\\">✓</span><span class=\\"codex-editorial-checklist__text\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/Checklist.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"27:10\\">Model tamper state as irreversible in CRM, warranty and service — do not let &#39;repair + reseal&#39; clear it.</span></li><li class=\\"codex-editorial-checklist__item\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/Checklist.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"25:51\\"><span class=\\"codex-editorial-checklist__mark\\" aria-hidden=\\"true\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/Checklist.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"26:74\\">✓</span><span class=\\"codex-editorial-checklist__text\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/Checklist.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"27:10\\">Shape the SUN URL as a GS1 Digital Link from day one so a future DPP scope expansion does not force an inlay re-spin.</span></li><li class=\\"codex-editorial-checklist__item\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/Checklist.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"25:51\\"><span class=\\"codex-editorial-checklist__mark\\" aria-hidden=\\"true\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/Checklist.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"26:74\\">✓</span><span class=\\"codex-editorial-checklist__text\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/Checklist.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"27:10\\">Define the grey-market response copy (branded &#39;genuine but out-of-region&#39;) before the first anomaly hits the dashboard.</span></li></ul>    </section> <section class=\\"codex-editorial-section codex-editorial-resource-shell\\" id=\\"useful-next-pages\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/ResourceGrid.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"31:81\\"> <h2 data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/ResourceGrid.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"32:7\\">Useful next pages</h2> <p class=\\"codex-editorial-section-intro\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/ResourceGrid.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"33:44\\">Use these linked product, guide and comparison pages to keep the next click specific and practical.</p> <div class=\\"codex-editorial-resource-grid\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/ResourceGrid.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"34:46\\"> <section class=\\"codex-card codex-editorial-card\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/ResourceCard.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"31:50\\"> <h2 data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/ResourceCard.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"32:7\\">Luxury NFC SKUs</h2> <p data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/ResourceCard.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"33:6\\">The tag variants we produce for leather goods, watches, sneakers, apparel, wine and packaging.</p> <div class=\\"codex-editorial-link-list\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/ResourceCard.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"34:42\\"> <a class=\\"codex-editorial-link-card\\" href=\\"/products/rfid-cards/ntag424-dna-tt-card/\\" data-astro-s