 data-astro-source-loc=\\"51:87\\"> <dt class=\\"codex-editorial-answer-label\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/CommercialTerms.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"52:50\\">Lead time</dt> <dd data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/CommercialTerms.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"53:13\\">Production 2-3 weeks after artwork and encoding sign-off; reorders on a 3-4 week cycle</dd> </div><div class=\\"codex-card codex-editorial-brief-card codex-commercial-terms__item\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/CommercialTerms.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"51:87\\"> <dt class=\\"codex-editorial-answer-label\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/CommercialTerms.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"52:50\\">Samples</dt> <dd data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/CommercialTerms.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"53:13\\">Free samples and RF test report with every order; courier at customer cost</dd> </div><div class=\\"codex-card codex-editorial-brief-card codex-commercial-terms__item\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/CommercialTerms.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"51:87\\"> <dt class=\\"codex-editorial-answer-label\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/CommercialTerms.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"52:50\\">Payment</dt> <dd data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/CommercialTerms.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"53:13\\">50% T/T deposit, 50% before shipment; Net 30/60 for established accounts; LC for large orders</dd> </div><div class=\\"codex-card codex-editorial-brief-card codex-commercial-terms__item\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/CommercialTerms.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"51:87\\"> <dt class=\\"codex-editorial-answer-label\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/CommercialTerms.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"52:50\\">Shipping</dt> <dd data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/CommercialTerms.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"53:13\\">FOB Shenzhen / Yantian; DHL, FedEx or EMS air freight; sea LCL / FCL for volume</dd> </div><div class=\\"codex-card codex-editorial-brief-card codex-commercial-terms__item\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/CommercialTerms.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"51:87\\"> <dt class=\\"codex-editorial-answer-label\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/CommercialTerms.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"52:50\\">Response</dt> <dd data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/CommercialTerms.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"53:13\\">Itemized quote within one business day, Mon-Fri (UTC+8)</dd> </div> </dl> <p class=\\"codex-commercial-terms__note\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/CommercialTerms.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"57:43\\"> <a class=\\"codex-editorial-snapshot-link\\" href=\\"/rfq/?product=rfid-keyfobs\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/CommercialTerms.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"58:61\\">Full terms in your quote →</a> </p> </section> <nav class=\\"codex-editorial-jump-nav\\" aria-label=\\"On this page\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/JumpNav.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"20:67\\"><p class=\\"codex-editorial-kicker\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/JumpNav.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"21:39\\">On this page</p><div class=\\"codex-editorial-jump-links\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/JumpNav.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"22:45\\"><a class=\\"codex-editorial-jump-link\\" href=\\"#at-a-glance\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/JumpNav.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"24:67\\">At a glance</a><a class=\\"codex-editorial-jump-link\\" href=\\"#why-a-wood-keyfob-instead-of-plastic-or-metal\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/JumpNav.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"24:67\\">Why a wood keyfob instead of plastic or metal</a><a class=\\"codex-editorial-jump-link\\" href=\\"#where-wood-keyfobs-underperform\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/JumpNav.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"24:67\\">Where wood keyfobs underperform</a><a class=\\"codex-editorial-jump-link\\" href=\\"#how-we-test-before-shipping\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/JumpNav.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"24:67\\">How we test before shipping</a><a class=\\"codex-editorial-jump-link\\" href=\\"#useful-next-pages\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/JumpNav.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"24:67\\">Useful next pages</a><a class=\\"codex-editorial-jump-link\\" href=\\"#faq\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/JumpNav.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"24:67\\">FAQ</a><a class=\\"codex-editorial-jump-link\\" href=\\"#next-step\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/JumpNav.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"24:67\\">Next step</a><a class=\\"codex-editorial-jump-link\\" href=\\"#quick-quote\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/JumpNav.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"24:67\\">Get a quote</a></div></nav> <section class=\\"codex-editorial-section\\" id=\\"why-a-wood-keyfob-instead-of-plastic-or-metal\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialSection.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"75:2\\"> <h2 data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialSection.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"76:7\\">Why a wood keyfob instead of plastic or metal</h2> <p class=\\"codex-editorial-section-intro\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/SectionIntro.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"19:2\\">ABS plastic and zinc-alloy keyfobs dominate the access-control market because they are cheap, durable, and easy to engrave. Wood keyfobs cost more, dent more easily, and need a sealed finish for outdoor use. They earn their place when the program needs a sustainability narrative or a premium tactile feel that plastic and metal cannot deliver.</p>        <ul class=\\"codex-editorial-list\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/SectionList.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"38:38\\"><li data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/SectionList.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"40:10\\">Biodegradable wood body; recyclable stainless-steel hardware (24 mm or 30 mm split ring).</li><li data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/SectionList.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"40:10\\">FSC chain of custody documented for sustainability audits.</li><li data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/SectionList.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"40:10\\">Distinct hand feel: the 35 × 30 × 4 mm body is warmer and quieter than ABS or zinc alloy.</li><li data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/SectionList.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"40:10\\">Laser-friendly: engraves crisply without ink lamination.</li><li data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/SectionList.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"40:10\\">Brand-positioning value: luxury, hospitality, eco-conscious memberships.</li></ul>     </section><section class=\\"codex-editorial-section\\" id=\\"where-wood-keyfobs-underperform\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialSection.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"75:2\\"> <h2 data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialSection.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"76:7\\">Where wood keyfobs underperform</h2> <p class=\\"codex-editorial-section-intro\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/SectionIntro.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"19:2\\">Honest about limits: a wood keyfob is not the right choice for every program.</p>        <ul class=\\"codex-editorial-list\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/SectionList.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"38:38\\"><li data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/SectionList.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"40:10\\">Outdoor or wet environments: humidity warps unsealed wood. Use lacquer or skip wood.</li><li data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/SectionList.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"40:10\\">Heavy-use industrial: ABS or zinc lasts longer in trades and industrial keyrings (24–36 months versus 12–18 for wood).</li><li data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/SectionList.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"40:10\\">Cost-sensitive bulk: PVC or ABS at high volume undercuts wood by 30–50%.</li><li data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/SectionList.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"40:10\\">Aggressive print artwork: wood grain shows through full-color UV print.</li><li data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/SectionList.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"40:10\\">Long-distance UHF: wood adds dielectric mass that detunes UHF antennas.</li></ul>     </section><section class=\\"codex-editorial-section\\" id=\\"how-we-test-before-shipping\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialSection.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"75:2\\"> <h2 data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialSection.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"76:7\\">How we test before shipping</h2> <p class=\\"codex-editorial-section-intro\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/SectionIntro.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"19:2\\">Every encoded keyfob passes the same QC pipeline as our plastic keyfobs, with a wood-specific finish check.</p>        <ul class=\\"codex-editorial-list\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/SectionList.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"38:38\\"><li data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/SectionList.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"40:10\\">100% functional read test on every encoded keyfob.</li><li data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/SectionList.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"40:10\\">Hardware torque test on the split ring attachment.</li><li data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/SectionList.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"40:10\\">Lamination and lacquer cure: 48 hours before engraving or shipping.</li><li data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/SectionList.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"40:10\\">Engraving QC: visual check on depth, contrast, registration.</li><li data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/SectionList.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"40:10\\">Pack-out: bulk poly bag, individual sleeve, or branded box on request.</li></ul>     </section> <section class=\\"codex-editorial-section codex-editorial-resource-shell\\" id=\\"useful-next-pages\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/ResourceGrid.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"31:81\\"> <h2 data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/ResourceGrid.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"32:7\\">Useful next pages</h2> <p class=\\"codex-editorial-section-intro\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/ResourceGrid.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"33:44\\">Use these linked product, guide and comparison pages to keep the next click specific and practical.</p> <div class=\\"codex-editorial-resource-grid\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/ResourceGrid.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"34:46\\"> <section class=\\"codex-card codex-editorial-card\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/ResourceCard.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"31:50\\"> <h2 data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/ResourceCard.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"32:7\\">Related keyfob SKUs</h2> <p data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/ResourceCard.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"33:6\\">Other keyfobs in the catalog with overlapping chip options or alternative materials.</p> <div class=\\"codex-editorial-link-list\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/ResourceCard.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"34:42\\"> <a class=\\"codex-editorial-link-card\\" href=\\"/products/rfid-keyfobs/em4305-keyfob/\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/ResourceCard.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"36:61\\"> <strong data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/ResourceCard.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"37:17\\">EM4305 keyfob (LF, ABS body)</strong>  </a><a class=\\"codex-editorial-link-card\\" href=\\"/products/rfid-keyfobs/mifare-desfire-keyfob/\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/ResourceCard.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"36:61\\"> <strong data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/ResourceCard.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"37:17\\">MIFARE DESFire keyfob</strong>  </a><a class=\\"codex-editorial-link-card\\" href=\\"/products/rfid-keyfobs/dual-frequency-key-fob/\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/ResourceCard.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"36:61\\"> <strong data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/ResourceCard.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"37:17\\">Dual-frequency keyfob</strong>  </a><a class=\\"codex-editorial-link-card\\" href=\\"/products/rfid-keyfobs/\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/ResourceCard.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"36:61\\"> <strong data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/ResourceCard.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"37:17\\">All RFID keyfobs</strong>  </a> </div> </section><section class=\\"codex-card codex-editorial-card\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/ResourceCard.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"31:50\\"> <h2 data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/ResourceCard.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"32:7\\">Compare and decide</h2> <p data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/ResourceCard.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"33:6\\">Pages that help with the keyfob-versus-card-versus-wristband decision and material choice.</p> <div class=\\"codex-editorial-link-list\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/ResourceCard.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"34:42\\"> <a class=\\"codex-editorial-link-card\\" href=\\"/compare/keyfob-vs-card-vs-wristband-access-control/\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/ResourceCard.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"36:61\\"> <strong data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/ResourceCard.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"37:17\\">Keyfob vs card vs wristband</strong>  </a><a class=\\"codex-editorial-link-card\\" href=\\"/contact/access-control-keyfobs/\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/ResourceCard.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"36:61\\"> <strong data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/ResourceCard.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"37:17\\">Start an access-control keyfob inquiry</strong>  </a><a class=\\"codex-editorial-link-card\\" href=\\"/products/rfid-cards/standard-rfid-wood-card/\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/ResourceCard.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"36:61\\"> <strong data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/ResourceCard.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"37:17\\">Wood RFID card (matching material)</strong>  </a> </div> </section> </div> </section> <section class=\\"codex-editorial-section\\" id=\\"faq\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/Faq.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"24:50\\"> <h2 data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/Faq.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"25:7\\">FAQ</h2> <div class=\\"codex-editorial-faq\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/Faq.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"26:36\\"> <details data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/Faq.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"28:16\\"> <summary data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/Faq.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"29:18\\">Can the wood keyfob open hotel-lock readers?</summary> <p data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/Faq.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"30:12\\">Yes, with the right chip. MIFARE Plus EV2 and MIFARE DESFire EV3 wood keyfobs work with Saflok, VingCard, Onity, Salto, and Häfele Dialock systems. Read range is shorter than a flat card because of the keyfob form factor; 2–4 cm is realistic on standard hotel readers.</p> </details><details data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/Faq.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"28:16\\"> <summary data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/Faq.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"29:18\\">How long does the wood keyfob last on a daily-use keyring?</summary> <p data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/Faq.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"30:12\\">Expect 12–18 months before noticeable wear from pocket use, friction against keys, and humidity. ABS or zinc-alloy keyfobs last 24–36 months in the same conditions. Wood is a deliberate trade-off: shorter life for tactile and sustainability value.</p> </details><details data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/Faq.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"28:16\\"> <summary data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/Faq.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"29:18\\">Is dual-frequency available?</summary> <p data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/Faq.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"30:12\\">Yes, on request. We can pair an HF chip (NTAG, MIFARE, ICODE) with a 125 kHz LF chip (EM4100 or EM4305) in the same wood body. Dimensions and lead time both increase. Confirm reader requirements before ordering.</p> </details><details data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/Faq.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"28:16\\"> <summary data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/Faq.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"29:18\\">Will the engraving fade?</summary> <p data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/Faq.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"30:12\\">Laser engraving carbonizes the wood and does not fade in normal use. UV print and color-fill engraving wear over time depending on handling. Sealed lacquer slows wear on all marking methods.</p> </details> </div> </section>  <section class=\\"codex-trust-signals\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/TrustSignals.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"15:38\\"> <div class=\\"codex-trust-stats\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/TrustSignals.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"16:34\\"> <div class=\\"codex-trust-stat\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/TrustSignals.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"17:35\\"> <strong data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/TrustSignals.astro\\" dat